    {
      "id": "verb-key-forms-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 778,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 108,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1b5e20",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 58,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔑 KEY FORMS (using 食べる as example):\n• て-form (connective): 食べて — links clauses, makes requests (〜てください)\n• た-form (past): 食べた — plain past (→ 食べました polite)\n• ない-form (negative): 食べない — plain negative (→ 食べません polite)\n• Potential: 食べられる — \"can eat\"\n• Passive: 食べられる — \"is eaten\"\n• Causative: 食べさせる — \"make/let eat\"\n• Volitional: 食べよう — \"let's eat\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔑 KEY FORMS (using 食べる as example):\n• て-form (connective): 食べて — links clauses, makes requests (〜てください)\n• た-form (past): 食べた — plain past (→ 食べました polite)\n• ない-form (negative): 食べない — plain negative (→ 食べません polite)\n• Potential: 食べられる — \"can eat\"\n• Passive: 食べられる — \"is eaten\"\n• Causative: 食べさせる — \"make/let eat\"\n• Volitional: 食べよう — \"let's eat\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
