      "text": "📙 な-ADJECTIVES (形容動詞)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "📙 な-ADJECTIVES (形容動詞)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "adj-na-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1490,
      "y": 592,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 115,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4a148c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 66,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Need な before nouns\nExample: 静か (しずか) = quiet\n\nPlain present:  静かだ\nPlain past:     静かだった\nPlain negative:  静かではない\nPlain neg. past: 静かではなかった\n\nPolite: 静かです・静かでした\nて-form: 静かで (links clauses)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Need な before nouns\nExample: 静か (しずか) = quiet\n\nPlain present:  静かだ\nPlain past:     静かだった\nPlain negative:  静かではない\nPlain neg. past: 静かではなかった\n\nPolite: 静かです・静かでした\nて-form: 静かで (links clauses)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
