    {
      "id": "adj-compare-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1030,
      "y": 745,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 22,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4a148c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 68,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚡ QUICK COMPARISON — Modifying Nouns:",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚡ QUICK COMPARISON — Modifying Nouns:",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "adj-compare-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1030,
      "y": 775,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4a148c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 69,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "い-adj + noun:     高い本 = expensive book  (direct)\nな-adj + noun:     静かな部屋 = quiet room  (needs な!)\n\nConjugation pattern: い-adj change the い ending; な-adj use だ・です・な as needed\n\nBoth can be used as predicates:  空が青い。= The sky is blue.  |  部屋が静かだ。= The room is quiet.\nBoth use て-form to chain:  高くて静か = expensive and quiet  |  静かで広い = quiet and spacious",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "い-adj + noun:     高い本 = expensive book  (direct)\nな-adj + noun:     静かな部屋 = quiet room  (needs な!)\n\nConjugation pattern: い-adj change the い ending; な-adj use だ・です・な as needed\n\nBoth can be used as predicates:  空が青い。= The sky is blue.  |  部屋が静かだ。= The room is quiet.\nBoth use て-form to chain:  高くて静か = expensive and quiet  |  静かで広い = quiet and spacious",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
