      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔴 HONORIFIC (尊敬語) — Elevate others",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔴 HONORIFIC (尊敬語) — Elevate others",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "polite-sonkeigo-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 1032,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 65,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#b71c1c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 80,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• お/ご〜になる: お食べになる\n• Special verbs: 食べる→召し上がる, 言う→おっしゃる\n• 〜れる/られる: 食べられる (respectful)\n• Used for superiors' actions — NOT your own!",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• お/ご〜になる: お食べになる\n• Special verbs: 食べる→召し上がる, 言う→おっしゃる\n• 〜れる/られる: 食べられる (respectful)\n• Used for superiors' actions — NOT your own!",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
