      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 85,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "📊 POLITENESS SCALE (LOW → HIGH):",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "📊 POLITENESS SCALE (LOW → HIGH):",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "polite-scale-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1170,
      "width": 1830,
      "height": 55,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#b71c1c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 86,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "食べる (casual)  →  食べます (polite)  →  召し上がります (honorific, for others)  →  いただきます (humble, for self)\n\nRule of thumb: Use polite (ます/です) with strangers & colleagues. Use honorific for boss's actions. Use humble for your own actions toward boss.\nCasual is for close friends, family, and when you're clearly senior. Getting this wrong can be rude or create unwanted distance!",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "食べる (casual)  →  食べます (polite)  →  召し上がります (honorific, for others)  →  いただきます (humble, for self)\n\nRule of thumb: Use polite (ます/です) with strangers & colleagues. Use honorific for boss's actions. Use humble for your own actions toward boss.\nCasual is for close friends, family, and when you're clearly senior. Getting this wrong can be rude or create unwanted distance!",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
